6, 2782, 353, 116], 'MODULI': [2311, 2579, 797, 1447, 719, 2963, 2777, 977]} (keys: [REMAINDERS, MODULI]).\nGive your final answer to 25 significant figures, then call submit_answer with that number."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "This is a CRT problem. I'll write a script that returns the result as a string via stdout since 25 sig figs exceeds float precision.", "tool_calls": [{"id": "toolu_01L2THrdj4WAA2Q4xqfSBWxa", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "write_script", "arguments": "{\"code\": \"def solve(inputs: dict) -> float:\\n    from functools import reduce\\n    R = inputs['REMAINDERS']\\n    M = inputs['MODULI']\\n    R = [int(x) for x in R]\\n    M = [int(x) for x in M]\\n    prod = 1\\n    for m in M:\\n        prod *= m\\n    total = 0\\n    for r, m in zip(R, M):\\n        p = prod // m\\n        total += r * p * pow(p, -1, m)\\n    x = total % prod\\n    print(\\\"ANSWER_STR:\\\", x)\\n    return float(x)\", \"name\": \"crt\"}"}}, {"id": "toolu_01Fmtg1BzzpaMBVetfgh18pp", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "run_script", "arguments": "{\"name\": \"crt\", \"inputs\": {\"REMAINDERS\": [1920, 968, 763, 226, 516, 2782, 353, 116], \"MODULI\": [2311, 2579, 797, 1447, 719, 2963, 2777, 977]}}"}}]}, {"role": "tool", "tool_call_id": "toolu_01L2THrdj4WAA2Q4xqfSBWxa", "content": "{\"ok\": true, \"message\": \"Saved script 'crt' (394 chars).\", \"scripts\": [\"crt\", \"lcg\"], \"writes_remaining\": 1, \"tokens_remaining\": 299211}"}, {"role": "tool", "tool_call_id": "toolu_01Fmtg1BzzpaMBVetfgh18pp", "content": "{\"ok\": true, \"return_value\": 24.0, \"stdout\": \"ANSWER_STR: 9554127197258020039051653\\nANSWER: 9.55412719725802e+24\", \"tokens_remaining\": 299211}"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "The exact answer is 9554127197258020039051653. To 25 sig figs, that's all 25 digits.", "tool_calls": [{"id": "toolu_012oTnAk5H5zk1wCVGy5a6VJ", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "submit_answer", "arguments": "{\"value\": 9554127197258020039051653}"}}